      "q": "29. Nalorphene (${{C}_{19}}{{H}_{21}}N{{O}_{3}}$ ), similar to morphine, is used to combat withdrawal symptoms in narcotic users. Dose of nalorphene generally given is 1.5 mg. Calculate the mass of $1.5\\times {{10}^{-3}}$ m aqueous solution required for the above dose.",
