      "q": "3. Draw the structures of the following compounds:\n\n(i)  3-Methylbutanal",
      "a": "The structure of 3-Methylbutanal is given below:\n\n![3-Methylbutanal](https://www.vedantu.com/seo/content-images/b24ffcaa-ba9b-44e5-89ed-5fd8c58b17b3_13..png)\n\n(ii)  p-Nitropropiophenone\n\nAns: The structure of p-Nitropropiophenone is given below:\n\n![p-Nitropropiophenone](https://www.vedantu.com/seo/content-images/8fbbd88c-ba84-4505-bc2b-3ac13d9a0e32_14..png)\n\n(iii) p-Methylbenzaldehyde\n\nAns: The structure of p-Methylbenzaldehyde is given below:\n\n![p-Methylbenzaldehyde](https://www.vedantu.com/seo/content-images/33b28e75-885d-436c-9284-09c20add0eb8_15..png)\n\n(iv) 4-Methylpent-3-en-2-one\n\nAns: The structure of 4-Methykpent-3-en-2-one is given below:\n\n![4-Methylpent-3-en-2-one](https://www.vedantu.com/seo/content-images/580962d7-4a45-47ca-8503-b774dd787d3e_16..png)\n\n(v) 4-Chloropentan-2-one\n\nAns: The structure of 4-Chloropentan-2-one is given below:\n\n![4-Chloropentan-2-one](https://www.vedantu.com/seo/content-images/df4f32c9-74aa-4302-ab10-2be917095930_17..png)\n\n(vi) 3-Bromo-4-phenylpentanoic acid\n\nAns: The structure of 3-Bromo-4-phenylpentanoic acid is given below:\n\n![3-Bromo-4-phenylpentanoic acid](https://www.vedantu.com/seo/content-images/16f6f3f5-0810-4f48-93bb-e98eccbf1564_18..png)\n\n(vii) p,p’-Dihydroxybenzophenone\n\nAns: The structure of p,p’-Dihydroxybenzophenone is given below:\n\n![p,p’-Dihydroxybenzophenone](https://www.vedantu.com/seo/content-images/38f649e9-192c-40a3-94a5-3f16e6054ec7_19..png)\n\n(viii) Hex-2-en-4-ynoic acid\n\nAns: The structure of Hex-2-en-4-ynoic acid is given below:\n\n![Hex-2-en-4-ynoic acid](https://www.vedantu.com/seo/content-images/c036d350-6a2f-44c4-a48a-383d045b833c_20..png)"
